      "q": "Who are the attorneys at Freidin Brown?",
      "a": "Freidin Brown names 40 attorneys on its own site, and each is listed on this profile with the page we read them from. They have not been checked against a state register: Florida does not publish an attorney register we can query, so licensure is not verified here. The state's own attorney search is the place to check it."
